WEBVTT

00:05.800 --> 00:08.500
Enough... let it end.

00:09.480 --> 00:14.500
I shall petition Imperial Father to strip my princely rank and reduce me to a commoner. Only then will Eldest Brother rest easy.

00:16.360 --> 00:21.500
From now on, we shall conceal our names and live as humble commoners among the quiet mountains.
